#N canvas 40 40 1100 760 12;
#X text 20 5 [atom-sq-glitch] - Pulsar glitch identity (pulsar-glitch: cyan #05F9FE and magenta #D646FF sparks \, calm most of the time \, hard-cut bursts). on sq-native: 3 s splash \, PULSAR glitching in the middle of the screen and cyan / magenta rings spreading from the centre of the pads. then sq-ready \, and PULSAR stays bottom right (field 13): white \, one burst every 4 s and a flicker. loaded by atom-sq-map;
